 (text "Firmware map: SDA=GPIO0, SCL=GPIO1, page=GPIO3, red=GPIO4, piezo=GPIO5, mode=GPIO6, blue=GPIO10." (at 40 139 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))) (text "Mode switch: AI shorts COM to GND; SYS leaves COM open for INPUT_PULLUP. OLED module is external." (at 40 143 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))) (text "Use a passive piezo disc on J3; do not connect a high-current magnetic buzzer directly to GPIO5." (at 40 147 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)))
